ts/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.mp4?t=1788204584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/faae5306af670af93e8623eea3a6e309.avif?t=1788204584\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/faae5306af670af93e8623eea3a6e309.avif?t=1788204584 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No magazines or classic reloading. Your weapons are equipped with Internal Ammo Generators powered by radioactive processors that love to heat up. The Ammo Generators create bullets right while you shoot, but the price for this is instant and critical overheating that will burn your fingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE TEMPERATURE, NOT AMMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up to 3 weapons on a mission. From the &quot;Siris&quot; automatic rifle to the heavy &quot;Grimolip&quot; shotgun - balance on the brink of overheating so your weapon doesn't shut down in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVEMENT IS YOUR SUPERPOWER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use lightning-fast slides, jumps, and momentum to slice through crowds of enemies and dodge their projectiles. Believe me, in Daisen, you can't stand still, because those who do are dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEAL BY KILLING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no medkits in the game. Collect hot orange essence from slain enemies and use the Mender device to inject it straight into your veins to instantly heal your wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUAL CYCLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After exhausting raids, return to the Daisen hub office. Rest, buy new weapons with your earned hryvnias, or just enjoy the relaxing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOODSTORM MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the arena against endless waves of enemies while listening to your own music playlist. Prepare for sudden debuff events: from total blindness to poisonous fog, or random weapon rentals in the &quot;casino slots.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/82d351b58f8eeb5053ef32f2973cb3f4.poster.avif?t=1788204584\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/82d351b58f8eeb5053ef32f2973cb3f4.webm?t=1788204584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/82d351b58f8eeb5053ef32f2973cb3f4.mp4?t=1788204584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/d181a704d8317b6ae8aadae7d417fc7b.avif?t=1788204584\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/d181a704d8317b6ae8aadae7d417fc7b.avif?t=1788204584 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community and chat with the game developers on our <strong><i>Discord</i></strong> server. The community is waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.poster.avif?t=1788204584\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.webm?t=1788204584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.mp4?t=1788204584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Daisen is a hyper-fast-paced shooter where healing only comes through killing, and your weapons are always eager to overheat at the worst possible moment. Mix up your arsenal, &quot;dance&quot; across the arena, and remember: the line between you and the anomaly is thinner than it seems, Ms. Emilia.",
